 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Impersonal uses",
     "texto": [
      "**Conviene**, **occorre**, **basta**, **vale la pena** can take an infinitive: **Conviene partire presto** (it's better to leave early).",
      "With an infinitive they are usually in the third-person singular; with a noun subject they can also agree: **Occorrono due documenti**, **Bastano pochi minuti**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Impersonal verbs for happening",
     "texto": [
      "**Capita** (it happens), **succede** (it happens), **accade** (it occurs): **Capita di sbagliare** (it happens that you make a mistake).",
      "With **ci** you say «it happens to us»: **Ci succede** (it happens to us)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
